      "line": "what the price implies",
      "label": "CALCULATION",
      "text": "At ₹1,380 (NSE close, 23 Nov 2026), the reinvestment-phase discounted cash flow model (Template B, since DRREDDY's median return on invested capital of 21.6% is above its 8.67% cost of capital) matches the price if revenue grows about 16.8% a year for five years at the FY26 operating margin of 13.0%; DRREDDY's revenue grew 11.0% a year over FY23–FY26.",
